<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A6" title="In Lego-Edit: A General Image Editing Framework with Model-Level Bricks and MLLM Builder" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F </span>Prompt Example for Producing Ground Truth Data</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
