<section id="A6" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix F </span>Prompt Example for Producing Ground Truth Data</h2>

<div id="A6.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Listing <a href="#LST2" title="Listing 2 ‣ Appendix F Prompt Example for Producing Ground Truth Data ‣ Lego-Edit: A General Image Editing Framework with Model-Level Bricks and MLLM Builder" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> provides an exemplar prompt specifically used for generating ground truth training data for the environment change task.</p>
</div>
<figure id="LST2" class="ltx_float ltx_lstlisting">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float">Listing 2: </span>Prompt Example for Generating Ground Truth Data for the Environment Change Task</figcaption>
